# Keeps web/assets/download/ present in git even though web/assets/ is
# gitignored (the Android APK is a 51MB out-of-band artifact, not source).
# The Dockerfile copies this directory; the .apk rides along in release builds
# where an operator has placed it here, and is absent in CI / from-source builds
# (the /download/android endpoint then returns a friendly 404).
